@startuml
actor Author
participant KnowledgeCLI
boundary SourceRegistry
participant SampleStore
participant Marcado
participant AtomCorpus
database MetadataRegistry
participant SLDB

Author -> KnowledgeCLI: register source artifact
KnowledgeCLI -> SourceRegistry: persist path + source_hash_sha256
Author -> KnowledgeCLI: create sample / biopsy
KnowledgeCLI -> SampleStore: cut verifiable sample from source
Author -> KnowledgeCLI: annotate sample
KnowledgeCLI -> Marcado: open sample for semantic markup
Marcado -> SampleStore: persist ranges and anchors
Author -> KnowledgeCLI: add distilled atom
KnowledgeCLI -> AtomCorpus: write atom with provenance to sample
KnowledgeCLI -> MetadataRegistry: write governance metadata
KnowledgeCLI -> SLDB: refresh index and graph projections
@enduml